[TITLE]
Provenance: pyswmm/swmm-nrtestsuite/crates/solver/tests/data/lid/test_w_wo_*_2Subcatchments.inp.
Exercises every SWMM LID process and GHCND climate-file input in one runoff model.

[OPTIONS]
